# astrx-websearch seed URLs — one absolute URL per line.
# Blank lines and everything after a '#' are ignored.
#
# By default the crawler is scoped to the *hosts* of these seeds (it will not
# wander off-site). Pass --scope-domain to broaden to whole domains, or --broad
# to crawl the open web. robots.txt and Crawl-delay are always honoured unless
# you pass --no-robots.

https://example.com/
https://www.example.org/

